        ":question/problem": "Find the value of ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}$ given that $3a+2x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,x=\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}24 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
