        ":question/problem": "Find the value of ${x}_{1}-{x}_{2}$ given that  $4a+3x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,x=\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}18 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
